  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that the matter described above is lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\nThe use of an office on the second floor of Falcon House, Central Way by 'Diplomat Executive Cars' for administrative and call centre purposes only in relation to the management of a chauffeur business would be lawful as the use would fall within Class B1 of the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, which is the current usage of the associated building and does not therefore require planning permission.\r\n"
